@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed bounded observability pipeline — products not selected
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Web / owner operations" as W
rectangle "Workers / scheduler / adapters" as J
rectangle "Operating process / resource observations" as O
rectangle "Bounded structured event / metric / span creation\nOperation/attempt identity; no secrets or private payload dumps" as E
rectangle "Validate / filter / redact / limit\nRestricted metadata and bounded cardinality" as F
rectangle "Collector / export responsibility\nLibrary, local agent or optional service pending" as C
database "Restricted diagnostic storage\nRetention/access policy pending" as S
rectangle "Health / queue age / outcome views\nActual observation and investigated findings" as V
W --> E
J --> E
O --> E
E --> F
F --> C
C --> S
S --> V
legend bottom
 Correlation identifiers aid diagnosis; untrusted incoming trace metadata is not authority or permission.
 Metrics/traces are not the authoritative business command/audit ledger.
 Required audit durability and telemetry-outage behavior need an explicit owner contract, not silent loss or secret leakage.
endlegend
@enduml
